lines:
本打算偷袭你的，
但看你好像打算在橙华森林里{be00}
呆一辈子，{be01}
我等得不耐烦了，
干脆直接现身！

嗯？你知道自己在做什么吗？
什么，你要保护他？{be01}
就算你只是个孩子，
和海洋队作对也没好下场！{be01}
来对战吧！

Grrr... You’ve got some nerve
meddling with Team Aqua!{be00}
Come on and battle me again!{be01}
I wish I could say that, but I’m out of
Pokémon...{be01}
And, hey, we of Team Aqua are also
after something in Rustboro.{be01}
I’ll let you go today!

Whew...
That was awfully close!{be01}
Thanks to you, he didn’t rob me of
these important papers.{be01}
I know, I’ll give you a Great Ball as
my thanks!

这是奇迹种子，
让宝可梦携带的话，{be00}
它的草属性招式就会变强。{be01}
我想除了奇迹种子，
还有其它能让宝可梦携带的便利道具。

Trainer Tips{be01}
Any Pokémon that appears even once
in a battle is awarded Exp. Points.{be01}
To raise a weak Pokémon, put it at the
left of the team list.{be01}
As soon as a battle starts, switch it
out. It will earn Exp. Points without{be00}
being exposed to any harm.

有用的公告牌！{be01}
除了被打击点数HP(体力)，
宝可梦还拥有用来在战斗中发动招式的{be00}
招式点数(PP)。{be01}
如果宝可梦的PP值耗尽，必须把它
带到宝可梦中心去。
